{"author":{"id":"e8ccbc170af88335916e23a1b24e48c04b0a4af82e988d5245cc91e39d6a9e2c"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1794491104,"nonce":"UaVefsdn66jTo2rfAJQR4DWj6Ug=","title":"L4 — Gemini client with free-tier rate limiter","message":"## Context\nThe user is on Gemini's free tier, so every call must go through a client-side limiter. This layer is plan Task 6 (`docs/superpowers/plans/2026-11-12-maeve.md:239`).\n\n## Files\n- `src/llm/mod.rs`, `src/llm/gemini.rs`, `src/llm/limiter.rs` — new; export from `src/lib.rs`\n- `Cargo.toml` — add `reqwest` (json, rustls-tls), `base64`; dev: `wiremock`\n\n## Approach\n- Implement plan Task 6 Interfaces: `Part`, `LlmRequest` (with `wait_tx`), `LlmError`, `Llm` trait, `RateLimiter` (sliding window, `acquire` returns time waited), `GeminiClient::{new, with_base_url}`\n- `POST {base}/v1beta/models/{model}:generateContent`, header `x-goog-api-key`, `responseMimeType: application/json` + `responseSchema`; images as base64 `inline_data`\n- Every request, retries included, calls `acquire`. On 429, honour `RetryInfo.retryDelay`, max 3 retries\n\n## Out of scope\n- Prompt content and output validation (L5)\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- All plan Task 6 Step 1 tests pass (wiremock + `tokio::time::pause`), including 401/403 → `LlmError::Auth` after exactly one request (Review Focus 5) and 429 → wait reported on `wait_tx`\n- The API key never appears in errors or `Debug` output\n- Gates pass: `cargo fmt --check`, `cargo clippy --all-targets -- -D warnings`, `cargo test`","files":null}]}